                                "sense_id": "999078d4-d814-328b-8c26-4a668ea45ce6",
                                "text": "Setting aside what was done yesterday, we began by proposing an equal exchange of gold for gold, and silver for silver, and after no small delay made them produce two ichibu, whose weight we compared with our dollars; […]"
